## **Phase 1: Structure Optimization & Architecture (Weeks 1-4)**

### **1.1 Code Organization Refactoring**
- **Objective**: Establish modular, maintainable architecture
- **Action Items**:
  ```
  app/
  ├── routes/          # Remix route handlers
  ├── components/      # Shared UI components
  │   ├── common/      # Generic reusable components
  │   ├── layout/      # Layout components
  │   ├── forms/       # Form-specific components
  │   └── modals/      # Dialog/modal components
  ├── services/        # Business logic & API calls
  │   ├── ai/          # AI model integration
  │   ├── auth/        # Authentication
  │   ├── storage/     # Data persistence
  │   └── workspace/   # Project/workspace management
  ├── hooks/           # Custom React hooks
  ├── stores/          # State management (Zustand/Nanostores)
  ├── utils/           # Utility functions
  ├── types/           # TypeScript definitions
  └── styles/          # Global styles & theme
  ```

- **Performance Gains**: Better tree-shaking, clearer dependencies, easier code splitting
- **Deliverable**: Module dependency graph documentation

### **1.2 Type Safety Enhancement**
- **Objective**: 100% TypeScript coverage, strict mode
- **Action Items**:
  - Enable `strict: true` in `tsconfig.json`
  - Create branded types for domain models (e.g., `type UserId = Brand<string, 'UserId'>`)
  - Implement Zod schemas for runtime validation
  - Add strict null checks across codebase

- **Deliverable**: TypeScript strict mode migration PR

### **1.3 Build Configuration Optimization**
- **Objective**: Reduce bundle size, improve dev experience
- **Current Config**:
  - Vite with Remix plugin + UnoCSS + Node polyfills
  - Electron separate builds (main/preload/renderer)

- **Improvements**:
  - Implement dynamic imports for code splitting
  - Add bundle analyzer (`rollup-plugin-visualizer`)
  - Optimize Electron asset loading (lazy load heavy modules)
  - Configure CSS purging more aggressively

- **Deliverable**: Bundle size reduced by 30-40%, dev build <2s cold start

